thub.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Issue #6886 solves an issue with backup restore where restores were failing since the schemas of the ysql_dump-created table and imported-snapshot table differed on column being nullable.  Apparently, this mismatch could occur on old releases, so the fix in commit d4b6ece62ba1d0aee0b436c54b1fa3e933795a60 was to ignore the mismatch.\r\n\r\nHowever, this fix missed the secondary code path where namespace id and table id matched.  This code duplication should be removed so that these mistakes don't happen again.\r\n\r\nRepro:\r\n\r\n1. Get 2.2.0.0 release\r\n2. Create 2.2.0.0 cluster\r\n3. Run in `ysqlsh`:\r\n\r\n   ```sql\r\n   CREATE DATABASE new;\r\n   \\c new\r\n   CREATE TABLE t (i int);\r\n   ALTER TABLE t ADD j int NOT NULL;\r\n   ```\r\n\r\n4. Do distributed backup on database `new` (https://docs.yugabyte.com/latest/manage/backup-restore/snapshot-ysql/)\r\n5. Create cluster using latest master (or probably any recent one like 2.6.0.0)\r\n6. Run in `ysqlsh`:\r\n\r\n   ```sql\r\n   CREATE DATABASE new;\r\n   ```\r\n\r\n7. Attempt distributed backup restore (https://docs.yugabyte.com/latest/manage/backup-restore/snapshot-ysql/), but fail on the `import_snapshot` with error\r\n\r\n   ```\r\n   Error running import_snapshot: Invalid argument (yb/master/catalog_manager_ent.cc:1222): Unable to import snapshot meta file /path/to/snapshot/file: Found by id 00004000000030008000000000004001 PGSQL_TABLE_TYPE table 't' in namespace id 00004000000030008000000000000000 has schema={Schema [\r\n           10:ybrowid[binary NOT NULL PARTITION KEY],\r\n           11:i[int32 NULLABLE NOT A PARTITION KEY],\r\n           12:j[int32 NULLABLE NOT A PARTITION KEY]\r\n   ]\r\n   properties: contain_counters: false is_transactional: true consistency_level: STRONG use_mangled_column_name: false num_tablets: 2 is_ysql_catalog_table: false retain_delete_markers: false}, expected={Schema [\r\n           0:ybrowid[binary NOT NULL PARTITION KEY],\r\n           1:i[int32 NULLABLE NOT A PARTITION KEY],\r\n           2:j[int32 NOT NULL NOT A PARTITION KEY]\r\n   ]\r\n   ```\r\n\r\nCreating a new database is necessary so that the namespace ids match.  Old clusters have less system catalog entries, so the `yugabyte` database's pg_database oid is slightly smaller than in new clusters.  Since the repro requires namespace ids to match, we can achieve that by creating a new database as the first thing in the cluster.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/9909/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/9909/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]